|other_fields=
{{Information field |name=Notes |value=Description and date rely on the [http://www.griffith.ox.ac.uk/gri/4acphot.html Griffith Institute, Oxford] (1924-01-04) as well as on [[w:Howard Carter|Howard Carter’s]] [http://www.griffith.ox.ac.uk/gri/4sea2not.html diary]. According to the latter, the shrines were opened 1924-01-03, Burton present, while the diary notes “records” by Burton for 1924-01-04 only, so perhaps we see a kind of reenactment. Actually some work was needed for opening the third and the fourth door, unlikely with left-hand wings almost closed as on the present photograph.  }}
